            <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-2xl">💡</span> Tips for Success
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Play daily:</strong> Consistency is key to building wellness habits and maintaining your streak</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Journal regularly:</strong> Reflect on your emotions and track patterns in your wellness journey</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Read articles:</strong> Expand your knowledge with expert-reviewed mental health content</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
